                            <comment id="16255191" author="mcherkasov" created="Thu, 16 Nov 2017 11:52:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;link to ul thread: &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Ignite-cassandra-module-issue-tt13808.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Ignite-cassandra-module-issue-tt13808.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
